  "findings": [
    "ListBox_AddItem stores the original string.",
    "ListBox_GetItems/GetItemText return original stored Items.",
    "GUIListBox::PrepareTextToDraw uses TransformTextForDrawing and get_translation when control translation flag is set.",
    "Therefore translated draw text does not mutate original script comparison keys.",
    "Original flags for ListBoxMessages, ListBoxEmailMessage1, ListBoxS3Contacts, ListNewsArticle, ListBoxS7User are84: no 0x80 translated flag. ListBox subclass list flags must not be mistaken for base control flags.",
    "Scrollers.MakeEmail and MakeScrollList split text before ListBox insertion and have no GetTranslation import. Enabling draw translation alone is insufficient for wrapped body paragraphs. Need translation before wrapping as well as list display flags."
  ],
